  translation {
    text: "The 16th St. FreeRide will operate a normal schedule on New Year’s Eve as crowds allow but will pause service, during both fireworks shows.\r\n\n    Final departure from Union Station at 12:52 a.m.\r\n    Final departure from Civic Center Station at 1:20 a.m.\r\n    Paused service may occur approximately 7 p.m.-1:30 a.m. due to the fireworks displays"
